"Wedding rentals online" usually means browsing a catalog and checking out with a card. That is not quite what Malaga Event Gear offers today, and it is worth being precise about which parts of booking the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) are genuinely online and which still involve a person. This page is about the booking process itself: what you can do on the site before anyone calls you back. For delivery, service area and what actually shows up at your venue, see our [wedding rentals near me](/blog/wedding-rentals-near-me/) guide instead, since that ground is already covered there.

## Brief Overview

---

Two things about booking with Malaga Event Gear genuinely happen online: you can see the Wedding Pack's real price on the site before contacting anyone, and you can submit a full quote request through our [contact form](/contact/) without a phone call or a visit. What does not happen online yet is final confirmation. A team member reviews your request and confirms the booking by phone, WhatsApp or email. There is no cart, no instant checkout and no online payment. If that is the specific thing you searched for, this page tells you exactly where the online process currently ends.

## Key Highlights

---

- Wedding Pack pricing, 650 euros ex VAT, is published on the [packages page](/packages/wedding/) itself. You do not need to ask anyone what it costs.
- The [contact form](/contact/) takes your date, venue, guest count and event details entirely online, protected against spam and bots.
- Final confirmation is a human step, by phone, WhatsApp or email, not an automated checkout.
- No showroom exists to visit at any point in this process, before or after the quote request.

## What You Can See Online Before Contacting Anyone

Most rental businesses that require a showroom visit do it because pricing depends on a conversation, a walkthrough, or negotiation. Malaga Event Gear does not work that way. The Wedding Pack's price, 650 euros ex VAT for up to 80 guests, is listed on its [packages page](/packages/wedding/) along with the standard 21 percent Spanish VAT noted separately, so you know the net figure and the tax breakdown before you fill in a single field. The same is true across our other packages. You can compare what is included, what the price is, and decide whether it fits your event without a single call.

That transparency is the part of "online" that is fully real today. Nothing about the price is revealed only after you reach out.

<InlineCTA />

## Requesting a Quote Entirely Online

Once you know the Wedding Pack fits, the next step is our [contact form](/contact/), and this part is also genuinely online end to end. The form asks for your name, email, phone, event date, event type and any details about your venue or guest count you want to include. It is protected by Cloudflare Turnstile and rate limiting against spam, and bookings need at least 24 hours' notice, so the form will not accept a date sooner than that. Submitting it does not require a phone call, an in person meeting or a showroom visit. You type the details, submit, and the request is logged on our end.

That is a genuine online step, not a marketing description of one. It is also as far as automation goes today.

## Where the Online Process Ends

This is the honest part. After you submit the quote request, a team member reviews it and reaches out to finalize details and confirm the booking, by phone, WhatsApp or email. There is no instant confirmation screen, no online payment, and no automated checkout that locks in your date the moment you submit. We are working toward a fully self serve online booking experience with standardized pricing, but that is a stated goal for where the process is headed, not the current reality, and this page will not pretend otherwise.

In practice that means: the quote request itself takes a few minutes online, and the confirmation that follows takes a short reply from an actual person, usually the same or next business day. If you are comparing "wedding rentals online" against a service that promises instant self checkout, that promise does not exist here yet, and we would rather say so than have you find out at the confirmation stage.

## No Showroom, at Any Point in the Process

Malaga Event Gear has no physical showroom, and that holds true for booking as much as it does for delivery. You do not need to visit a location to see pricing, request a quote or get your booking confirmed. Every step, aside from that final human confirmation, happens without an in person meeting. This is a narrower claim than "no showroom to visit for delivery," which is covered fully in our [wedding rentals near me](/blog/wedding-rentals-near-me/) guide. Here it applies specifically to booking: nothing about getting a quote or confirming a date requires you to be anywhere in person.

## What Happens After Confirmation

Once your booking is confirmed, delivery, setup, live technical support during your event and teardown afterward are handled the way they always are for the Wedding Pack, covered in full in our [wedding rentals near me](/blog/wedding-rentals-near-me/) guide. This page stops at the booking process itself, since that is the part actually being searched for under "online."

