## Conclusion

"Wedding rentals online" with Malaga Event Gear means real published pricing and a real online quote request, both genuinely self serve. It does not yet mean instant automated checkout: a human confirms the booking after you submit your request, by phone, WhatsApp or email. No showroom is involved at any point. [Contact us](/contact/) to see current Wedding Pack pricing and request a quote.

## FAQs

### Can I book and pay for the Wedding Pack entirely online, with no phone call?

Not yet. You can see the price and submit a full quote request online, but a team member confirms the booking by phone, WhatsApp or email afterward. There is no online payment or automated checkout at this time.

### Is Wedding Pack pricing published online, or do I have to ask?

It is published. The Wedding Pack is 650 euros ex VAT, listed on the [packages page](/packages/wedding/) with VAT noted separately, before you contact anyone.

### Do I need to visit a showroom to get a quote or confirm a booking?

No. Malaga Event Gear has no showroom. Requesting a quote and confirming a booking both happen without an in person visit, aside from the final human confirmation step by phone, WhatsApp or email.

### How long does it take to hear back after submitting the online quote form?

Usually the same or next business day. Bookings need at least 24 hours' notice regardless, so submit your request as early as you can once your date and venue are set.
